	(text "Global net GND enters here only to carry a PWR_FLAG for ERC. USB_DP, USB_DN, AUX, CAN_P, CAN_N run Connector <-> Controller; CC1_SENSE, CC2_SENSE Connector -> Controller."
		(exclude_from_sim yes)
		(at 25.4 248.92 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "1b87095d-9df8-44c1-ae6b-905a1ecabf66")
	)
	(text "Root sheet. Signal flow: Power -> Front End -> Slicer/LVDS -> Connector. No AGC loop and no detector sheet (decision 12).\nMonitor sheet buffers VCM_REF (1.65 V baseline) and the RSSI minimum detector from TIA_TAP; the Controller (ESP32-C6, decisions 11/12) sets\nDAC_TH/DAC_HV/HV_DIS/SHDN_N/LE_HYS/TIA_CTRL, reads HV_MON/RSSI/VTH_MON, and talks CAN through the Connector; the single USB-C J50 on the Connector sheet carries VBUS, USB, LVDS, CAN and AUX (decision 14).\nStatus labels VERIFIED/PROPOSED/UNRESOLVED; no part values approved for fabrication."
		(exclude_from_sim yes)
		(at 25.4 15 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "3600de23-9279-4116-8600-fe8ef8ef310c")
	)
	(text "Rails VBUS (Connector -> Power and Controller; the single 5 V input, decision 14), 3V3, 3V3_D are sheet pins; +5V is internal to Power (U5 TPS259631 eFuse OUT); GND is global. HV_ nets and APD_BIAS are net class HV (1.0 mm clearance).\nLVDS_P is low for a logic one (post-amp non-inverting after an OPA857 whose OUT swings down with light); the FPGA inverts."
		(exclude_from_sim yes)
		(at 25.4 35 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "924888f7-2aeb-4fd9-a36f-664dfad0f782")
	)
